      "instance_name": "Mosque",
      "label": "Mosque",
      "description": "A place of worship for Muslims. The text in the meme specifies that the shootings occurred at 'mosques', which is crucial for understanding the religious context of the victims. The image does not show a mosque, but the text requires the viewer to know what a mosque is and its significance to Muslims to understand the meme's intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
